{"3426000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Capri Care", "steam_appid": 3426000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Capri Care</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an enchanting journey to the world of Lumenia, where you’ll encounter the adorable and mysterious creatures known as <strong>Capri</strong>! These playful, colorful beings are waiting for you to care for, train, and interact with them in a world full of endless fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interactive Capri</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know your Capri, each with its own personality, traits, and appearance. Build a bond with these creatures through love and care as you feed them fruit, play with them, and nurture their growth. The more attention you give, the more your Capri will thrive—boosting their stats and abilities for exciting adventures ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426000/extras/2184eb9d43cda2848df183810287fd02.poster.avif?t=1778278953\" width=948 height=552 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426000/extras/2184eb9d43cda2848df183810287fd02.webm?t=1778278953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426000/extras/2184eb9d43cda2848df183810287fd02.mp4?t=1778278953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Minigames Galore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your Capri on thrilling adventures through a variety of fun and competitive minigames. Race through challenging foot races, compete in tug-of-war matches, and search for hidden treasures in the island’s wild terrain! Each minigame is a chance to level up your Capri, unlock special abilities, and win rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426000/extras/96f640220a60e743ff3d22f89bd922b1.poster.avif?t=1778278953\" width=1152 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426000/extras/96f640220a60e743ff3d22f89bd922b1.webm?t=1778278953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426000/extras/96f640220a60e743ff3d22f89bd922b1.mp4?t=1778278953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Breeding and Colors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the art of Capri breeding! Breed your creatures to unlock new, unique color patterns, and create even more adorable companions. Experiment with different pairings to discover rare genetic traits and create the ultimate Capri collection.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fishing and Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the lush environments of the Wild Isle, from its sandy beaches to lush forests and mysterious caves. Grab your fishing rod and cast into sparkling waters to catch rare fish, which you can use to boost your Capri’s stats or simply enjoy the serenity of nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426000/extras/a1622ac4b9b5addf95efadd6576de17b.poster.avif?t=1778278953\" width=1152 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426000/extras/a1622ac4b9b5addf95efadd6576de17b.webm?t=1778278953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426000/extras/a1622ac4b9b5addf95efadd6576de17b.mp4?t=1778278953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feed and Grow</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your Capri fruits, creatures to enhance their abilities. Each food has a different effect—some increase speed, others improve strength, and more. Manage your resources wisely to create the most powerful garden of Capri.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426000/extras/acc72ea4be4b759dd335b58e9710d5ee.poster.avif?t=1778278953\" width=1152 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426000/extras/acc72ea4be4b759dd335b58e9710d5ee.webm?t=1778278953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426000/extras/acc72ea4be4b759dd335b58e9710d5ee.mp4?t=1778278953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customization and Growth</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your Capri's appearance and stats, watch them evolve, and train them for ultimate success in both competitions and exploration. Develop strategies to take on the island’s various challenges, unlock new areas, and meet even more adorable creatures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426000/extras/670ef11ef621557cdbccba9829b35ca6.poster.avif?t=1778278953\" width=1152 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426000/extras/670ef11ef621557cdbccba9829b35ca6.webm?t=1778278953\" type=\"v