ith hidden surprises and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect rare items and food to enhance your Capri’s growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing and playful experience perfect for all ages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the world of <strong>Capri Care</strong> and discover the joy of building your own creature family and exploring a magical world full of surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >minigames and interactive play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable Capri creatures with unique stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vibrant and relaxing world to explore and enjoy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless possibilities for breeding, training, and nurturing your Capri.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash levels and Puzzles to progress the growth of your Capri</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note: At this moment Multiplayer is limited to an online lobby to show off your capri to friends.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Capri Care lets you care for and interact with adorable Capri creatures. Compete in fun minigames, breed new colors and traits, and explore a vibrant island. Feed, train, and bond with your Capri to unlock new adventures and surprises in this magical world!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426000/c22cf279af4a1b1077243d198167e9d830538040/header.jpg?t=1778278953", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426000/ad912958c789efece26718138ea711d967ecb447/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778278953", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor